2026-09-23 — L11 inventory, not additional atomic implementation.

The three CASEs in atomic-scope-boundaries.c distinguish general _Atomic
updates, __atomic RMW/CAS/exchange, and generic aggregate atomic load/store.
All 12 fixed ARM64 reference runs exit zero: GCC 14.2.0-19 / Clang 19.1.7,
each at -std=gnu11 -O0/-O2, CASE=0/1/2. Command in the offline sealed image:
  $cc -std=gnu11 -O$opt -DCASE=$case_id atomic-scope-boundaries.c -o probe
  ./probe
